---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Icon from '../../components/Icon.astro';
---

<Layout title="Developer Quickstart" description="Build on Boing Network with the CLI and RPC.">
  <article class="page-wrap-full">
    <header class="page-hero-full">
      <div class="page-wrap-inner" style="max-width: 800px;">
        <span class="stage-badge-global">Testnet</span>
        <h1 class="quickstart-title"><Icon name="rocket" size={36} class="quickstart-title-icon" /> Developer Quickstart</h1>
        <p class="lead">From zero to your first native token on Boing Testnet in five steps.</p>
      </div>
    </header>
    <div class="page-wrap-inner quickstart-content" style="max-width: 800px;">
    <section class="section-reveal delay-1" id="steps">
      <h2><Icon name="rocket" size={22} class="section-icon" /> Five steps</h2>
      <ol class="steps">
        <li>
          <strong>Install the CLI.</strong> Build <code>boing</code> from source (Rust stable). <code>boing token</code> is newer than the latest published release binaries (<a href="https://github.com/Boing-Network/boing.network/releases" target="_blank" rel="noopener">GitHub Releases</a>), so build from <code>main</code> until the next release:
          <pre><code>git clone https://github.com/Boing-Network/boing.network.git
cd boing.network
cargo build --release -p boing-cli   # binary: target/release/boing</code></pre>
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Get a signing key.</strong> Create a wallet in <a href="https://boing.express" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Boing Express</a>, then use <em>Settings → Reveal private key</em> (password required) and set it only in your local shell:
          <pre><code># PowerShell
$env:BOING_SECRET_HEX = "&lt;64-hex private key&gt;"
# bash/zsh
export BOING_SECRET_HEX=&lt;64-hex private key&gt;</code></pre>
          Never commit it or paste it into chat. Use a dedicated testnet wallet.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Fund it.</strong> Request testnet BOING from the <a href="/faucet">faucet</a>. A token deploy costs about 10–20 BOING, so you may need two requests (one every 60 seconds).
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Deploy a token.</strong>
          <pre><code>boing --rpc-url https://testnet-rpc.boing.network token deploy --symbol TKN --name "My Token" --initial-supply 1000000</code></pre>
          The CLI prints your token address. Add <code>--dry-run</code> to see the signed transactions without sending them.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Verify.</strong>
          <pre><code>boing --rpc-url https://testnet-rpc.boing.network token balance --token &lt;token address&gt; --holder &lt;your address&gt;</code></pre>
          Or look up the token address on <a href="https://boing.observer" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Boing Observer</a>. Transfer with <code>boing token transfer --token … --to … --amount …</code>.
        </li>
      </ol>
    </section>

    <section class="section-reveal delay-2" id="create-token">
      <h2><Icon name="link" size={22} class="section-icon" /> Ways to create a token</h2>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>No code:</strong> the deploy wizard on <a href="https://boing.finance" target="_blank" rel="noopener">boing.finance</a> (Boing Testnet, signed with Boing Express).</li>
        <li><strong>CLI:</strong> <code>boing token deploy</code>, shown above.</li>
        <li><strong>TypeScript:</strong> <code>boing-sdk</code> <code>buildReferenceFungibleDeployMetaTx</code> (see the repository <code>boing-sdk/README.md</code>).</li>
      </ul>
      <p>All three use the canonical reference fungible template (QA purpose <code>token</code>). The minimal template allows exactly <strong>one</strong> mint (fixed supply), and the first caller becomes admin. Details: repository <code>docs/BOING-REFERENCE-TOKEN.md</code>.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="section-reveal delay-2">
      <h2><Icon name="link" size={22} class="section-icon" /> Other CLI commands</h2>
      <ul>
        <li><code>boing init</code>: scaffold a dApp project</li>
        <li><code>boing dev</code>: start a local dev chain (RPC on <code>http://127.0.0.1:8545</code>)</li>
        <li><code>boing deploy</code>: check RPC reachability before deploying</li>
        <li><code>boing token mint | transfer | balance | bytecode</code></li>
      </ul>
    </section>
    <section class="section-reveal delay-3">
      <h2><Icon name="node" size={22} class="section-icon" /> RPC</h2>
      <p>Default port: <code>8545</code>. Full method list and error codes: <a href="/docs#rpc-api">Documentation → RPC API</a> (mirrors repository <code>docs/RPC-API-SPEC.md</code>). Use <code>boing_health</code> or <code>boing_getNetworkInfo</code> for chain id, limits, and <code>developer.dex_discovery_methods</code>. TypeScript: in-repo <code>boing-sdk/</code> (see repo <code>boing-sdk/README.md</code>).</p>
    </section>

    <section class="section-reveal delay-4">
      <h2><Icon name="book" size={22} class="section-icon" /> Crates (reference)</h2>
      <table>
        <thead>
          <tr><th>Crate</th><th>Description</th></tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
          <tr><td><code>boing-primitives</code></td><td>Types, hashing (BLAKE3), cryptography</td></tr>
          <tr><td><code>boing-consensus</code></td><td>PoS + HotStuff BFT</td></tr>
          <tr><td><code>boing-state</code></td><td>State store (sparse Merkle commitments; Verkle upgrade path in specs)</td></tr>
          <tr><td><code>boing-execution</code></td><td>VM + parallel scheduler</td></tr>
          <tr><td><code>boing-tokenomics</code></td><td>Emission and block-timing constants</td></tr>
          <tr><td><code>boing-automation</code></td><td>Scheduler, triggers, executor incentives</td></tr>
          <tr><td><code>boing-governance</code></td><td>Governance helpers for the protocol stack</td></tr>
          <tr><td><code>boing-telemetry</code></td><td>Logging and RPC telemetry helpers</td></tr>
          <tr><td><code>boing-qa</code></td><td>Deploy-time QA rules used by execution</td></tr>
          <tr><td><code>boing-cli</code></td><td><code>boing init</code>, <code>boing dev</code>, <code>boing deploy</code>, <code>boing token</code></td></tr>
          <tr><td><code>boing-p2p</code></td><td>libp2p networking</td></tr>
          <tr><td><code>boing-node</code></td><td>Node binary</td></tr>
        </tbody>
      </table>
    </section>
    </div>
  </article>
</Layout>

<style>
  .quickstart-title { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; gap: 0.5rem; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 0 0.5rem; }
  .quickstart-title-icon { color: var(--accent-teal); flex-shrink: 0; }
  .page-hero-full .lead { margin: 0; color: var(--text-secondary); }
  .quickstart-content { padding-bottom: 3rem; }
  .quickstart-content section { margin-top: 2.5rem; }
  .quickstart-content h2 { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.4rem; margin-bottom: 0.75rem; color: var(--text-primary); font-size: 1.25rem; }
  .section-icon { color: var(--accent-teal); flex-shrink: 0; }
  .steps { padding-left: 1.2rem; color: var(--text-secondary); }
  .steps li { margin-bottom: 1.1rem; }
  .steps pre { margin: 0.5rem 0; padding: 0.75rem; background: var(--bg-tertiary); border-radius: 6px; overflow-x: auto; }
  .steps pre code { background: none; padding: 0; white-space: pre; }
  table { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; }
  th, td { padding: 0.5rem 0.75rem; text-align: left; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-color); color: var(--text-secondary); }
  th { color: var(--text-tertiary); font-weight: 600; }
  .quickstart-content code { background: var(--bg-tertiary); padding: 0.2em 0.4em; border-radius: 4px; font-size: 0.9em; word-break: break-word; }
  .quickstart-content a { color: var(--accent-teal); }
  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .quickstart-content { padding-bottom: 2rem; }
    .quickstart-content section { margin-top: 2rem; }
    table { font-size: 0.85rem; display: block; overflow-x: auto; -webkit-overflow-scrolling: touch; }
    th, td { padding: 0.4rem 0.5rem; }
  }
  @media (max-width: 375px) {
    .quickstart-content section { margin-top: 1.5rem; }
  }
</style>
